          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute increases in energy‑supply stress (e.g., gas/oil shortfalls) raise near‑term inflation and growth uncertainty, prompting markets to reprioritize toward a tighter or more persistent central‑bank policy path." />
