          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Curtailment of overland and Black Sea exports increases reliance on seaborne shipments from Gulf producers to Europe/Asia, raising tanker transits through Suez and Bab el‑Mandeb." />
