          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A fast increase in export controls, sanctions and compliance rules tied to the US–China tech rivalry raises shipping compliance costs, forces route changes and elevates war-risk insurance premiums for tankers, quickly driving up freight rates for oil shipments." />
