          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening sovereign spreads for Russia (or its external backers) raises external borrowing costs and limits access to international credit, constraining defense procurement, ammunition purchase and force sustainment and thereby reducing the capacity for sustained conventional operations." />
